<span id="A5.T6.2.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Refines the initially retrieved candidates by filtering irrelevant or misleading examples through the agent’s reasoning, mitigating semantic noise.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:139.1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.1.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T6.2.1.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">structural_alignment</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.1.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.4pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.1.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Reorganizes textual structures of retrieved candidates, reducing structural noise and improving consistency with the query.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
